=== meta ===
rule: ASSERT_REMOVED
title: `if not True:` parks an assertion just as dead as `if False:`
origin: fable audit — _is_literal did not fold Not/Compare/BoolOp
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
from app import total


def test_total():
    assert total(3) == 6
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
from app import total


def test_total():
    if not True:
        assert total(3) == 6
